    title "Elvis Presleys Death Story"
    description "On August 16th, 1977, Elvis Presley died at his Memphis home at the age of 42 years old. In this episode, we&#8217;re going to show you a video reconstruction of Elvis Presley's death scene. You'll also learn why Elvis Presley died and what caused Elvis's death.&#10;&#10;Elvis&#8217;s drug addiction had been developing since early 1960's. That&#8217;s when he started abusing substances to cope with an exhaustive concert schedule. Elvis&#8217;s death was similar to the deaths of Michael Jackson and Heath Ledger &#8212; we had reviewed their cases in previous episodes.&#10;&#10;________________________________________&#10;&#10;* Need an animated video for yourself or your business?&#10;https://www.how-it-was.com&#10;&#10;* Follow us on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/howitwasofficial&#10;&#10;* Follow us on Facebook:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/howitwasofficial&#10;&#10;________________________________________&#10;&#10;Contents of This Video:&#10;00:00&#8203; - Elvis Presley is watching TV in his bedroom in Graceland&#10;00:53&#8203; - Elvis complains to Ginger Alden about his tooth pain&#10;01:06 - Elvis goes to the bathroom to read a book&#10;01:16 - Elvis's date of death and age at death&#10;01:20 - Elvis's becoming a rock-and-roll superstar&#10;02:00 - Why Elvis Presley's appearance changed so much?&#10;02:30 - Elvis Presley's diet and eating habits&#10;03:03 - What killed Elvis Presley&#10;03:15 - Elvis Presley is developing an addiction to sedatives&#10;04:00 - Elvis's tight concert schedule before his death&#10;04:35 - Was anyone trying to help Elvis combat his addiction?&#10;04:45 - Elvis surrounds himself with the &#34;Yes&#34; people&#10;05:04 - Elvis pays his staff members &#10;05:20 - Dr. Nick is assisting Elvis Presley and prescribes him all kinds of drugs&#10;05:40 - A precise story of Elvis Presley's death&#10;06:35 - Elvis is reading the book &#34;The Scientific Search for the Face of Jesus&#34;&#10;06:55 - Ginger Alden finds Elvis Presley's dead body in his bathroom in Graceland&#10;07:05 - The official cause of Elvis Presley's death&#10;07:18 - The unofficial cause of Elvis Presley's death&#10;07:34 - Outro"
