    id 10
    label "eQYAQeuqnS4"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-11T10:00:30Z"
    title "Disturbing Details Found In Elvis Presleys Postmortem Report"
    description "To die-hard fans, Elvis Presley is still the king of rock 'n' roll &#8212; despite having died way back in 1977. And while the near-mythical musician's celebrated career is worth a deep dive of its own, it's his tragic passing at the age of 42 that continues to confuse fans. Why? Well, simply put, a slew of details regarding his death have been kept from Presley's adoring public.&#10;&#10;For whatever reason, the musician's father Vernon Presley requested that his son's autopsy remain sealed until 2027, the 50th anniversary of his son's death. Still, a publicly available medical examiner's report was completed, and, while it doesn't shed as much light as a formal autopsy report, it does provide some insight into the final moments of a legend. These are disturbing details found in Elvis Presley's postmortem report.&#10;&#10;#Elvis #TheKing #RockAndRoll&#10;&#10;Read full article: https://www.grunge.com/647658/disturbing-details-found-in-elvis-presleys-autopsy-report/"
