    title "[ SCENE OF DEATH: The Clearest Look EVER!"
    description "EXCLUSIVE: FULL VIRTUAL TOUR of Elvis' private 2nd floor of Graceland is the King's final secret. It was where he could truly be alone and it is where he passed away on 16th August 1977. Ever since then, this &#34;inner sanctum&#34; has been locked up like a vault with only his daughter Lisa Marie and his ex-wife Priscilla allowed to access the upstairs hallowed halls. This video presents the ABSOLUTE CLEAREST AND MOST DETAILED look around Elvis' private 2nd floor ever! Some of the King's hidden treasures are highlighted for the first time- such as &#34;The Man In The Arena&#34; which hangs on Elvis' wall! The master bathroom where Elvis died is seen here in never-before-seen clarity...FORBIDDEN GRACELAND is forbidden no more! These are genuine images of Elvis' upstairs quarters, taken in 1981, and presented here with unique commentary, notations and analysis!&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;Small tips are always appreciated&#128591; just look for the SUPER THANKS button under all my videos. Or you can sponsor me monthly and become a valued MEMBER of the J.R. as Elvis family. This will get you access to exclusive perks:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRpoMYZq4C3bQrKSnC71mIw/join&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HSZ7-OH23ag&#10;[&#8308;&#7479;] --COMPLETE UPSTAIRS TOUR-- ELVIS' GRACELAND 2nd Floor &#38; SCENE OF DEATH: The Clearest Look EVER!&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WBeczWE0eZA&#10;ELVIS SAYS &#34;F%CK YOU&#34; TO A HATER IN AUDIENCE- Las Vegas, Aug 30 1974 | 3am Show&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rMDFnzHguLM&#10;ELVIS: &#34;THEY SAID I WAS STRUNG OUT ON HEROIN!!!&#34; -RAW &#38; UNCUT- Onstage Drugs Speech &#38; Paternity Suit&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pWkXfNAlXoI&#10;Elvis' Autopsy Report: The TRUTH AT LAST | Why It Will NEVER Be Released To The Public&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XOv0iCFzfzo&#10;ELVIS SPEAKS! He Gives EXACT Reason For Divorcing Priscilla --FULL &#38; UNCUT VERSION--&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xxvARmQn-yc&#10;ELVIS' INCREDIBLE TCB RING on Display @ The O2, London | Massive Gold, Diamond &#38; Onyx Masterpiece&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPFs4D0Kt2o&#10;PRISCILLA PRESLEY: Shattered Beauty | The TRUE Tragic Ending of Elvis' Ex-Wife: BOTCHED SURGERY!&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1OGvmdNopqk&#10;BENJAMIN KEOUGH BURIED AT GRACELAND: PICTURES | Elvis' Grandson Rests With King&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bznhr7sguQc&#10;&#9989;UPDATED: INSIDE BENJAMIN KEOUGH'S FUNERAL | Open Coffin &#38; Decorated With Cherry Blossoms&#10;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#9671;&#10;ALSO WATCH: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hSP1xJTirZ0&#10;THE