    label "xYZIcWU4lO8"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-18T00:00:11Z"
    title "What If... ELVIS PRESLEY live to 2030? | Face  Songs"
    description "What If Elvis Presley didn't die in 1977? If he lived and made songs, albums, live concerts and tour until 2050? What would happened to Elvis Presley if he still were alive? Semi-fictioned evolution timeline with the face transformation of King of Rock and Roll, since 1954 to 1977 being realistic with his bio, discography, live concerts, tours, interviews, documentarys, awards, hits... and since 1977 to 2030 with an imaginative simulation of what his face and life could have been up to 95 years of age. Not a fan-made tribute, being realistic but with respect and love to the artist, his work and songs. Fair Use video with cultural and aesthetic purposal. Free copyright music by Epidemic Sound.&#10;&#10;SUPPORT THIS CHANNEL! (only 1$): &#10;youtube.com/AngelodiCarpio/join&#10;and https://patreon.com/AngeloDiCarpio &#10;&#10;&#191;Qu&#233; hubiera pasado con Elvis Presley si &#233;l siguiera vivo? Cronolog&#237;a semi-ficcionada con el cambio en la cara del Rey del Rock and Roll, desde 1954 a 1977 siendo realista con su biograf&#237;a, discograf&#237;a, conciertos en vivo, giras, entrevistas, documentales, ceremonias de premios, hits... y desde 1977 a 2030 con una visual simulaci&#243;n de lo que hubiera sido su cara y su vida hasta los 95 a&#241;os de edad. No es un tributo fan, he tratado de ser realista pero con respeto y amor al artista y sus canciones. Video Fair Use por tener s&#243;lo prop&#243;sitos culturales y est&#233;ticos.&#10;&#10;Histoire et &#233;volution de Elvis Presley de 1954 &#224; 2030, ann&#233;e par ann&#233;e. Le visage, l'apparence, la biographie, les albums, les meilleures chansons et concerts, les tourn&#233;es, les interviews, les documentaires, les prix, etc., dans une superbe vid&#233;o de l'histoire r&#233;elle &#224; la fiction. Toujours r&#233;aliste mais respectueux du chanteur et de leur musique."
