    title "ELVIS PRESLEYS LAST CONCERT BEFORE DEATH #elvispresley"
    description "June 26, 1977:  Elvis Presley's  Last Concert Before Death &#10;&#10; On June 26  , 1977, Elvis Presley was on  stage for the last time.  No  one thought  that  it was a  sign that the  next two months the legend said goodbye from the world. &#10;&#10;Memphis Mafia, as Elvis Presley  fans call it with a heavy heart, had to give up the departure of the &#34;King of Rock and Roll&#34;.  Because the late Elvis  died on August 16, 1977.&#10;&#10;Elvis was found lying in the bathroom of his home and was immediately rushed to The Baptist Memorial  hospital. Unfortunately,  Elvis' life was not saved when he arrived at the hospital.&#10;&#10;  He also breathed his last when he turned 42 years old.  His death is a deep sorrow for the world  music industry.&#10;&#10;The cause of  Elvis Presley's  death is not yet known for certain and continues to be the world's big question. Some say  cardiac arrest, overdose, drug abuse  and  much more.&#10;......"
