    title "816 The Day Elvis Presley Died OFFICIAL TRAILER 2 minute version 816 Elvis (video)"
    description "2014 documentary about the day Elvis Presley, the King of Rock N Roll passed away in his Memphis, Tennessee mansion Graceland&#10;I began working on this film back in August of 2003 during Elvis Week and over the next decade I interviewed hundreds of fans, performers, and friends of Elvis including two of his step brothers Billy and Rick Stanley and Memphis Mafia member Sonny West.&#10;&#10;We cover the initial announcement of his death, the arrival of fans, the viewing of his body in Graceland, the drunk driving incident, the commercialization, and the funeral procession.&#10;Please LIKE 'THUMBS UP' and Comment on this video&#10;&#10;This is a shorter version of the trailer &#10;&#10;This trailer was shot and edited by me Carey Rayburn. This documentary '816' is owned by me Carey Rayburn, I am the director and have all rights necessary to post my trailer to youtube.&#10;Check us out on facebook at https://www.facebook.com/pages/816-Movie/103174963097080&#10;and https://www.facebook.com/OutlawFilmProductions"
