  [
    id 160
    label "ZqObtA5euww"
    step 0
    date "2020-08-15T13:04:11Z"
    title "Michael Jackson ILMOMJ"
    description "#MichaelJackson #LisaMariePresley #ElvisPresley #BenjaminKeough #ElvisGrandson #MJItaSub #CristianaMarchioretto &#10;- - - Per attivare i sottotitoli in italiano cliccare sull'icona &#34;cc&#34;. - - -&#10;&#10;&#10;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;ENG&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#10;&#10;&#10;Tribute dedicated to Elvis Presley for the 43rd anniversary of his death. (January 8,1935 - August 16, 1977)&#10;I wanted to make a sort of parallelism between Elvis and Michael, two pioneers who marked their era withq futuristic dance moves and unforgettable pieces of music.&#10;&#10;I created a sort of virtual duet between the two to the notes of &#34;For The Good Time&#34;, one of Michael's mom's favorite songs, Katherine Jackson,  in a piano instrumental version. A second virtual duet is instead on the notes of &#34;Killing Me Softly with this Song&#34;.&#10;&#10;I also created a sort of section, INSPIRATION AND EVOLUTION, in which I enjoyed comparing some of their legendary dance steps. Probably some of Michael's dance steps were inspired by Elvis and then reworked ... Comments on you!&#10;&#10;&#34;Study the greats and become greater&#8221; &#8211; Michael Jackson.&#10;&#10;United by the same tragic destiny I hope they can now dance and sing together up there in absolute joy!&#10;&#10;&#10;***************************************************&#10;&#10;If you like this video, click LIKE!&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to my channel if you have not already done!&#10;&#10;HIT the Notification Bell to not miss the next video!&#10;&#10;***************************************************&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;YOUTUBE CHANNEL: http://www.youtube.com/xyana75 &#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/xyana.ilmomj&#10;&#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/XIlmomj&#10;&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/XYANA75&#10;&#10;FACEBOOK PAGE: https://www.facebook.com/Xyana-&#4326;-In-L...&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;ITA&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176;&#176; &#10;&#10;Tributo dedicato ad Elvis Presley per il 43esimo anniversario della sua morte.&#10;(Tupelo, 8 gennaio 1935 &#8211; Memphis, 16 agosto 1977)&#10;&#10;Ho volto fare una sorta di parallelismo fra Elvis e Michael, due pionieri che hanno segnato la loro epoca con passi di danza avveniristici e pezzi di musica indimenticabili.&#10;&#10;Ho creato una sorta di duetto virtuale fra i due sulle note di una delle canzoni preferite della mamma di Michael, Katherine Jackson, &#34;For The good Time&#34; in versione strumentale da pianoforte. Un secondo duetto virtuale &#232; invece sulle note di &#34;Killing Me Softly with His Song&#34;.&#10;&#10;Ho creato inoltre una sorta di sezione, ISPIRATION AND EVOLUTION, in cui mi sono divertita a paragonare alcuni loro mitici passi di danza. Probabilmente alcuni passi di danza di Michael sono stati ispirati da Elvis e poi rielaborati... A voi i commenti in merito!&#10;&#10;&#34;Study the greats and become greater&#8221; &#8211; Michael Jackson.&#10;(&#34;Studia i grandi e diventa pi&#249; grande&#34; - Michael Jackson.)&#10;&#10;Uniti dallo stesso tragico destino spero ora possano danzare e cantare assieme lass&#249; nella gioia assoluta!&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; **************************************************&#10;&#10;Se ti piace questo video, fai clic su MI PIACE!&#10;&#10;ISCRIVITI al mio canale se ancora non l'hai fatto!&#10;&#10;ATTIVA la Campanella delle notifiche per non perdere il prossimo video!&#10;&#10;**************************************************&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;YOUTUBE CHANNEL: http://www.youtube.com/xyana75 &#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/xyana.ilmomj&#10;&#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/XIlmomj&#10;&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/XYANA75&#10;&#10;&#10;Pagina Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/&#1052;&#953;c&#1085;&#945;&#1108;l-J&#945;c&#1082;...&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;............................................................&#10;&#10;**DISCLAIMER** ALL COPYRIGHTS OF AUDIO AND IMAGES CONTENT OF THIS VIDEO DON'T BELONG TO ME. I DO NOT OWN THE RIGHTS TO ANY OF THE AUDIO AND IMAGES CONTENT OF THIS VIDEO. THE AUDIO AND VIDEO CLIPS ARE UPLOADED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY. THEREFORE NO COPYRIGHT INFRINGEMENT IS INTENDED"
