  [
    id 198
    label "fP27hJhQ984"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-18T16:31:46Z"
    title "The Secret Life Of Elvis Presley"
    description "If you enjoy this video, please show your support by hitting the subscribe button! Thank you &#10084;&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#10;&#10;Elvis Presley is widely regarded as one of the greatest singers and icons of  the 20th Century. But, the King of Rock and Roll had a secret (and sometimes dark) life he kept hidden from the public.&#10;&#10;From his insane eating habits and his romantic relationships to his pioneering fashion and the threats against his life, there's a lot more to his story than meets the eye!&#10;&#10;In this video we discuss:&#10;&#10;0:15 Elvis Presley - Fashion Icon&#10;Famed for his outfits, most notably the American Eagle jumpsuit worn at the Aloha From Hawaii concert that was broadcast via satellite around the world, Elvis had a unique style and fashion sense (not to mention hairstyle and sideburns!) &#10;&#10;1:30 Elvis Twin Brother &#38; Early Career&#10;From tragedy at birth, Elvis went on to make a name for himself from a young age in his hometown of Tupelo, Mississippi. He was heavily influenced by rockabilly and was eventually discovered by Mississippi Slim&#10;&#10;2:50 Elvis in the army &#38; meeting Priscilla&#10;During his army years, Elvis was stationed in Fort Hood, Texas, later moving to Friedberg, Germany. It was here that he met Priscilla Beaulieu (later to become his wife, Priscilla Presley). She was just 14 at the time.&#10;&#10;4:58 Marriage &#38; Lisa Marie Presley&#10;Soon after their marriage, Priscilla and Elvis welcomed Lisa Marie Presley into the world. Elvis was a dotting dad, but sadly after affairs by both parties, their marriage ended in divorce.&#10;&#10;5:54 Elvis Films &#10;As an actor, Elvis starred in many films most notably King Creole, Love Me Tender, Loving You and Jailhouse Rock. Most of the films also had accompanying songs which were huge successes.&#10;&#10;6:33 Rock n roll lifestyle&#10;Elvis' rock n roll lifestyle resulted in some interesting stories, especially when it came to Las Vegas!&#10;&#10;7:54 Elvis Presley Net Worth + Graceland&#10;Just how much was Elvis worth when he died? The answer might surprise you! Most of his earnings have been since his passing, with a large percentage of this generated by the Graceland &#38; Elvis Presley's Memphis tourist attractions - something that was actually Priscilla Presley's idea!&#10;&#10;9:16 Weight Gain, Death &#38; Fools Gold Loaf&#10;Elvis Presley's weight gain and unhealthy diet ultimately resulted in his untimely departure. His love for Fools Gold Loaf and peanut butter in general took its toll on his body.&#10;&#10;He may be gone, but his legacy still lives on to this day.&#10;&#10;Long Live The King!&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#10;Other videos you might enjoy:&#10;&#10;Elvis Presley's Grandson Looks Exactly Like The Legend - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4xscFTBwO80&#10;&#10;Dark Secrets Of Elvis Presley -  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jmOLT_P6pG8&#10;&#10;ELVIS - &#34;A Boy From Tupelo MS&#34; - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OmkWKr_vO6Q&#10;&#10;The Presley Family Is Hiding Some Skeletons In The Closet - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wsZRGZt-yT4&#10;&#10;Elvis and the women he dated - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QoCTDBiRIDI&#10;&#10;The Sad True Story Of Elvis Presley's Death - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7pswciaJHA4&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching, catch you on the next video!"
