    title "Fans mark 40 years since death of Elvis Presley"
    description "Forty years have passed since the death of Elvis Presley, who passed away aged 42. &#10;&#10;Dubbed the King of Rock and Roll, many wonder if he can still claim the title. &#10;&#10;Since his death, rock music has evolved in a way he probably would not have imagined. &#10;&#10;But it is still possible to see his influence in today's popular music. &#10;&#10;Al Jazeera's John Hendren reports from Memphis.&#10;&#10;- Subscribe to our channel: http://aje.io/AJSubscribe&#10;- Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AJEnglish&#10;- Find us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/aljazeera&#10;- Check our website: http://www.aljazeera.com/"
