    id 217
    label "6SHQHiGsLIc"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-16T20:00:01Z"
    title "Elvis Presleys Daughter Claims the Memphis Mafia Killed Him"
    description "Did you know that Elvis Presley had a large and intimidating entourage that was known colloquially as the &#8220;Memphis Mafia&#8221;, and that daughter Lisa Marie Presley feels that some members of said entourage helped contribute to her father&#8217;s death? Since the dawn of the modern entertainment industry, most celebrities have had an entourage of some kind. However, rock and roll legend Elvis Presley&#8217;s entourage was something else completely! The singer&#8217;s entourage initially consisted of close friends and family, but gradually grew to include outsiders as Elvis&#8217; needs became more and more exuberant. However, towards, the end of Elvis&#8217; life, most of these entourage members were let go by the singer&#8217;s father as a result of dwindling finances.&#10;&#10;&#9644;Contents of this video&#9644;&#10;00:00 - Intro&#10;00:55 - Body&#10;07:32 - Outro&#10;&#10;Like this content? Subscribe here: https://www.youtube.com/factsverse?sub_confirmation=1 &#10;&#10;Or, watch more videos here: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkXAntdjbcSKgHx6EQVOwNKVz1cR2hKV&#10;&#10;Elvis's daughter, Lisa Marie Presley, was born in 1968, and spent a good deal of time on her father&#8217;s Graceland property over the course of the first nine years of her life. During her time at Graceland, Lisa Marie became very acquainted with the Memphis Mafia and grew to fear them as a result of their debaucherous lifestyles.&#10;&#10;Today, Lisa Marie Presley blames her father&#8217;s former entourage with his demise just as much as she blames the man himself. After members of the Memphis Mafia were let go, a couple of them came together to write a tell-all book. This tell-all book was released only two weeks before Elvis&#8217; death, and Lisa Marie feels that it may have contributed to it! Join Facts Verse as we take a look at why Elvis Presley&#8217;s daughter claims the Memphis Mafia killed him.&#10;&#10;Elvis Presley&#8217;s Daughter Claims the Memphis Mafia Killed Him"
    channeltitle "Facts Verse"
    channelid "UCXZpQgX1897wYDLtvzmgyIA"
