    id 243
    label "dMikS0mjhew"
    step 0
    date "2012-08-16T20:06:34Z"
    title "Fans Celebrate Elvis Presley on 35th Anniversary of  Death"
    description "He may have died long before Twitter and Facebook&#8212;but Elvis Presley and his classic music will likely be heard and remembered all over the Internet today. &#10;&#10;Presley died Aug. 16, 1977 at the age of 42, and 35 years later he still holds on to chart-topping records. The King had over 100 hits on Billboard's Hot 100, and a whopping 124 albums that charted on the Billboard 200&#8212;including a fan-picked compilation that hit number 137 just last week. &#10;&#10;Today the artist is being celebrated by a vigil of thousands at Graceland in Memphis, Tenn., alongside a Presley first: an appearance by both Lisa Marie Presley and the early rock 'n' roll star's former wife, Priscilla. &#10;&#10;Another pop star is being celebrated today for a different reason&#8212;chart-topper Madonna turns 54 years old, despite what her years of Pilates and some surgery might suggest. Whether you're into the Material Girl or the King, it's a good day to make a Spotify playlist of all number ones!"
