    date "2017-08-17T00:56:22Z"
    title "Elvis Presleys death: Ch 4 Buffalo at WBEN Radio 8/17/77"
    description "From the Buffalo Stories archives: WBEN Radio paid music tribute to Elvis Presley in the hours following his death on August 17, 1977.  Speaking from Studio A at the WBEN studios on Elmwood Avenue was then 93/WBEN DJ Jay Fredericks (now better known as KNBC-TV weatherman Fritz Coleman) promoting Chris Tyler's Elvis retrospective and offering his thought's on Elvis Presley's death. This piece appeared on WBEN-TV Channel 4 (now WIVB-TV.)&#10;&#10;I garbage picked this and dozens of other tapes and films during a basement clean out at Channel 4 when I was a producer at the station in the late 90s."
    channeltitle "Buffalo Stories/staffannouncer"
