    title "The Truth About Elvis Presleys Relationship With Priscilla"
    description "Elvis Presley remains one of the biggest musicians in American history. And his relationship with his wife Priscilla was not only passionate, but it was also one of the most public relationships in all of Hollywood. Elvis met Priscilla while in the military, stationed in Germany. Their romance was a whirlwind that ultimately culminated in their highly publicized wedding.&#10;&#10;However, it wasn&#8217;t all sunshine and rainbows for the couple. Infidelity, absenteeism, and a host of other problems plagued the relationship behind the scenes from almost the very beginning. And though the two genuinely cared for each other, sometimes love just isn&#8217;t enough. Stay tuned, because this is the truth about Elvis Presley&#8217;s relationship with Priscilla.&#10;&#10;#Elvis #Priscilla #Relationships&#10;&#10;Priscilla was 14 | 0:00&#10;Elisabeth Stefaniak | 1:16&#10;Elvis gave Priscilla drugs | 2:09&#10;Priscilla did poorly in school | 3:03&#10;Elvis's affair with Ann-Margret | 4:11&#10;1966 Engagement | 5:22&#10;Married in Las Vegas | 5:59&#10;Honeymoon in Palm Springs | 6:34&#10;Birth of Lisa Marie | 7:14&#10;Priscilla had an affair | 7:58&#10;Divorced in 1973 | 8:46&#10;&#10;Read full article: https://www.grunge.com/903086/the-truth-about-elvis-presleys-relationship-with-priscilla-presley/"
