    title "Tragic Details About Lisa Marie Presley"
    description "She's a singer, a mother, a wife, and, oh yeah, the daughter of Elvis &#34;The King&#34; Presley. Lisa Marie Presley lived a life that few other people in the world can imagine, for all the good and bad that entails. And, unfortunately for Lisa Marie, there's been a lot of difficulty in her life, from being one of the first people to find her father's body at a young age to her own experience of a loss no parent deserves. Even for the daughter of the king of rock and roll, it wasn't an easy ride. These are the tragic details about Lisa Marie Presley.&#10;&#10;#Singer #LisaMariePresley #Life&#10;&#10;Finding her father's body | 0:00&#10;Marriage to Michael Jackson | 1:18&#10;Feeling responsible for Jackson's death | 2:31&#10;Legal battle with business manager | 3:46&#10;Marriage to Nicholas Cage | 4:54&#10;Living up to father's legacy | 5:51&#10;Drug abuse | 7:05&#10;Her son's tragic death | 8:34&#10;Forced out of her home | 9:45&#10;Divorce from Michael Lockwood | 10:43&#10;&#10;Read Full Article: https://www.nickiswift.com/232587/tragic-details-about-lisa-marie-presley"
