    date "2015-07-21T18:11:11Z"
    title "USA: MEMPHIS: 20TH ANNIVERSARY OF ELVIS PRESLEYS DEATH"
    description "(16 Aug 1997) Eng/Dutch/Nat&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;An estimated 100,000 Elvis fans from across the world are congregating in Memphis  today to mourn the 20th anniversary of Elvis's death.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Many people appear to 'live their lives' through idolising the man many consider to be  the 'King of Rock and Roll'.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Some have had their bodies tattooed with Elvis Presley's image and many have  travelled thousands of miles at great financial cost to themselves.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Elvis died on August 16, 1977. He was 42 years old. &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;The culmination of the week-long celebration at Graceland, home of the King of Rock  and Roll, comes tonight with a tribute concert. &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Graceland is the most visited residence in the United States after the White House, and  more than 50,000 are expected to have past through the house today. &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Elvis is buried alongside his mother, father and grandfather on the grounds of  Graceland.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;The grave itself is covered in wreaths, bouquets, letters, cards, poems, photographs  and miniature teddy bears costumed to look like Elvis and delivered by followers from  around the world. &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Memphis has been deluged with fans, impersonators, &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;SOUNDBITE: (English)&#13;&#10;''I've loved this guy for 25 years or more, and to finally arrive here and see Graceland, it's  marvellous.''&#13;&#10;SUPER CAPTION: Graham&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;SOUNDBITE: (English)&#13;&#10;''I've got 14 tattoos in total, starting from 20 year ago, and up to the present, I've started  on me back, and I'll continue until my back is totally full.''&#13;&#10;SUPER CAPTION: Graham&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;SOUNDBITE:  (Dutch) &#13;&#10;I wanted to come on the 20th anniversary of Elvis's death. I've been a fan for about 23  years. I had to leave my wife and children at  home to afford the trip, but Elvis is the  kink of rock and roll.&#34;&#13;&#10;SUPER CAPTION: Fan from Holland&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;SOUNDBITE: (English)&#13;&#10;&#34;Sikh's can Rock and Roll Too!&#34;&#13;&#10;SUPER CAPTION: Fan &#34;the Rocking Sikh&#34;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Find out more about AP Archive: http://www.aparchive.com/HowWeWork &#13;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/AP_Archive &#13;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/APArchives &#8203;&#8203;&#13;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/APNews/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;You can license this story through AP Archive: http://www.aparchive.com/metadata/youtube/38999c28f7a8c4c7af66070c817f22c2"
    channeltitle "AP Archive"
    channelid "UCHTK-2W11Vh1V4uwofOfR4w"
