    title "Amazing Grace - Elvis Presley"
    description "An immortal song sung by the all-time king of rock &#38; roll. Elvis loved singing gospel songs. Though taunted by demons in the last months of his life Elvis held on as best he could, to his faith in Jesus. No one who hears this interpretation of Amazing Grace fails to be touched by his voice, or the wondrous lyrics written by John Newton. The use of clouds and sky serve to remind me that the music of Elvis goes far, far beyond his untimely death."
