    description "#elvispresleyweek #elvisdeathambulance #history&#10;&#10;Today We Find a Piece of Elvis History with the Spa Guy!&#10;&#10;Follow the Spa Guy on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/user/tulsaj1965&#10;&#10;&#10;Attention all vinyl lover's!&#10;Talking Wax with ADIKA Live has moved to a new channel, Please head over there and subscribe!&#10;&#10;https://youtube.com/channel/UCpDurwXKpDiXuGBdsklxigg&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;I'd love for you to subscribe to my channel. Oh, and make sure to hit that notification bell, otherwise you won't get notified about our new videos!&#10;&#10;Mazel&#10;Stefan&#10;*************************************************&#10;Want Swag? &#10140; http://Adikalive.bigcartel.com&#10;&#10;Coffee Talk with ADIKA Live Podcast&#10140;&#10;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/coffee-talk-with-adika-live/id1529816802&#10;&#10;Join Patreon &#38; Get VIP Access &#10;Don't miss the Interactive, Live &#38; Uncut Experience!&#10;&#10;SUPPORT MY CHANNEL ON PATREON &#10140; https://www.patreon.com/The_adika_group?fan_landing=true&#10;&#10;Your Donation Helps Support your Favorite Show &#38; Channel &#10140; https://www.paypal.me/stephenadika1&#10;&#10;Adika's AMAZON WISHLIST Amazon Wish List &#10140; https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/30GQNR69L9048?ref_=wl_share&#10;&#10;CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE &#10140;  https://www.youtube.com/c/TheAdikaGroup?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Follow ADIKA Live on Facebook&#10140; @adikagroup&#10;&#10;Follow ADIKA Live on Instagram &#10140; https://www.instagram.com/adikalive/&#10;&#10;Follow ADIKA Live on Twitter&#10140; @talkadika&#10;&#10;Coffee Talk Fan Page&#10140;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/groups/coffeetalkfam/?ref=share&#10;&#10;Thank you for your support!"
