    title "Bing Crosby on the death of Elvis Presley August 16, 1977"
    description "Bing Crosby was performing what turned out to be his final concert in the United States on August 16, 1977 at the Concord Pavilion in Concord, California when the news broke that Elvis Presley had died. An NBC news correspondent was able to capture Bing's reaction to Elvis' death during an intermission. The photo accompanying this video was taken at that concert. Bing himself would pass away two months later, on October 14, 1977."
