    date "2020-08-14T13:00:30Z"
    title "Trying To Get To You - Elvis Presley Cover (Elvis Death Day Anniversary)"
    description "August 16th is &#34;Elvis Death Day&#34; around the world. And this year is a special one. Why? Because Elvis has now been dead (43 years) more years than he was alive (42). &#10;&#10;Elvis was the King of Rock and Roll. It wasn't just the dance moves early on in his career or his charisma or his handsome face. His singing voice was truly remarkable. He had tremendous range and never struggled. He made it all look so effortless. Imagine what a tragedy it would have been had he never started singing.&#10;&#10;That's why I find YouTube such a special. It gives everyone an opportunity. I love it!&#10;&#10;So I did it last year and just realized today that I really should do it this year. It's kind of a tradition. I must post an Elvis song. Here is &#34;Trying To Get To You.&#34;&#10;&#10;My new album is coming Sept 18th:&#10;&#10;The Orphus Years: 1996-2010&#10;&#10;Please checkout my Bandcamp page right now and FOLLOW me there:&#10;http://bradcarl.bandcamp.com. Do this and you will have yourself a free download of the album when it's released. It's that easy!&#10;&#10;If you're a musician who writes and records songs, you should already be on Bandcamp. If you have questions about it, let me know.&#10;&#10;Don't forget to LIKE, COMMENT, and SUBSCRIBE to my channel right here, folks!"
