    title "COLONEL TOM PARKER, THE BRAIN BEHIND ELVIS PRESLEYS SUCCESS, IS A MYSTERY #elvispresley"
    description "Colonel Tom Parker, the talent agent who managed rock 'n' roll legend Elvis Presley during the height of his fame, was frequently questioned over whether he was a scoundrel or a marketing genius.&#10;In the summer of 1984, Tony Stuchbury traveled from Manchester to Tupelo, Mississippi, the birthplace of Elvis Presley. Finally, the superfan would meet the man who created the legend.&#10; &#10;Colonel Tom Parker, not the King of Rock 'n' Roll, who had died seven years before, but the svengali who oversaw his every hip-swiveling move.&#10; &#10;Was Kingmaker Parker a marketing genius back then, as he is now? Or a con artist who cheated his one and only client to death?"
