  [
    id 403
    label "5oVqlqAjj2Y"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-02T19:15:00Z"
    title "Elvis: Real Life vs The Movie"
    description "Subscribe: http://bit.ly/Subscribe-to-Screenrant&#10;&#10;There are only a few names in history where you can just say their first name and you know exactly who I&#8217;m talking about. Elvis is one of those names. With a string of musician biopics released in the last few years, Bohemian Rhapsody and Rocket-man to name a few, it was only a matter of time until they did a movie on Elvis Presley and I&#8217;m shocked it took this long. The highest selling solo artist in history has quite the story. Baz Luhrmann took the director's chair for this project and really created a compelling story about the king of cool, Elvis. From sneaking into gospel churches, to escaping groupies to addiction, the king of cool had a rollercoaster ride and this movie covers it all. Let&#8217;s explore the fact versus fiction of what the movie depicts and what really happened, grab your hair gel and your flashiest jump suit and let&#8217;s rock. &#10;&#10;&#10;Chapters:&#10;&#10;0:00 - Intro &#10;0:54 - Elvis&#8217; Love For Captain Marvel Jr.&#10;1:40 - Young Elvis Went To Gospel Church&#10;2:28 - Elvis&#8217; Dad Convicted&#10;3:31 - How Elvis&#8217; Mother Died&#10;4:35 - How The Colonel Met Elvis&#10;5:26 - The Real Colonel&#10;6:15 - The Colonel Took Most Of Elvis&#8217; Money&#10;7:03 - Elvis Did Not Fire Colonel on Stage&#10;8:09 - &#8220;I Hate Elvis&#8221;&#10;9:09 - Colonel&#8217;s Gambling Debts&#10;9:56 - Hound Dog To A Hound Dog&#10;10:53 - Priscilla&#8217;s Age&#10;11:51 - A Star Is Born&#10;13:07 - Dr. Nic&#10;13:50- &#8216;68 Comeback Special&#10;14:46 - Outro&#10;&#10;Check out Screen Rant&#8217;s official TikTok! &#10;https://www.tiktok.com/@screenrant &#10;&#10;Our Social Media:&#10;https://twitter.com/screenrant &#10;https://www.facebook.com/ScreenRant  &#10;https://www.linkedin.com/company/screen-rant/ &#10;&#10;Our Website:&#10;http://screenrant.com/&#10;&#10;Video By: Joey Criscitello YouTube.com/OfficialJoeyC&#10;&#10;For copyright matters please contact us at: legal@valnetinc.com"
