    title "Hilarious Elvis Presley First Interview After Movies #shorts"
    description "The King, Elvis Presley making his return to live performances following the end of his movie contract. Here he is in his first quite funny interview where he discusses his return, along with some other questions posed to him by the media. He is very candid and open in his exchanges. And we can see the true character of the man come through. A huge loss to the world when the King of rock and roll passed away.&#10;&#10;All videos are created for educational purposes and no copyright infringement is intended. If you feel something is being infringed upon and you would like for me to take down any video, just drop a quick email to masculinitymindset@gmail.com and it will be done without hesitation.&#10;&#10;All clips used for fair use commentary, criticism, and educational purposes. See Hosseinzadeh v. Klein, 276 F.Supp.3d 34 (S.D.N.Y. 2017); Equals Three, LLC v. Jukin Media, Inc., 139 F. Supp. 3d 1094 (C.D. Cal. 2015).&#10;&#10;elon musk, tesla, technology, bitcoin, cryptocurrencies, cryptocurrency, crypto, money, making money, finance,  leadership, entrepreneurship, business, capitalism, donald trump, mindset, motivation, masculinity, interviews, quotes, speeches, great speeches, fighters, born fighter, shorts, shorts youtube, #shorts"
