    title "Elvis Presleys Grandson Benjamin Keough Dies At 27"
    description "Elvis Presley&#8217;s Grandson Benjamin Keough Dies At 27&#10;&#10;LOS ANGELES (CBSLA)&#160;&#8212; King of Rock&#8217;n Roll Elvis Presley&#8217;s grandson Benjamin Keough has died at 27 years old.&#10;&#10;Keough was the son of Lisa Marie Presley. Her representative confirmed Keough&#8217;s death on Sunday in a statement to Entertainment Tonight.&#10;&#10;&#8220;She is completely heartbroken, inconsolable and beyond devastated but trying to stay strong for her 11-year-old twins and her oldest daughter Riley,&#8221; the statement read. &#8220;She adored that boy. He was the love of her life.&#8221;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;-&#173;----------------------------------------&#173;--- &#128100;&#10;#benjamin_keough singing,&#10;benjamin keough singing elvis songs,&#10;benjamin keough presley singing,&#10;benjamin keough interview,&#10;benjamin keough music,&#10;benjamin keough singing everybody loves me,&#10;benjamin keough songs,&#10;benjamin keough 2020,&#10;benjamin keough album,&#10;benjamin keough and elvis presley,&#10;benjamin keough and michael jackson,&#10;benjamin keough 2019,&#10;benjamin keough 2018,&#10;#lisa_marie_presley songs,&#10;lisa marie presley interview,&#10;lisa marie presley 2020,&#10;lisa marie presley and elvis presley duet,&#10;lisa marie presley lights out,&#10;lisa marie presley singing,&#10;lisa marie presley dirty laundry,&#10;lisa marie presley and priscilla presley,&#10;lisa marie presley and elvis presley,&#10;lisa marie presley and michael jackson wedding,&#10;lisa marie presley american idol,&#10;lisa marie presley at michael jackson funeral,&#10;lisa marie presley and elvis presley duet in the ghetto,&#10;lisa marie presley and nicolas cage,&#10;lisa marie presley burning for you,&#10;lisa marie presley biography,&#10;lisa marie presley book,&#10;lisa marie presley birthday,&#10;lisa marie presley best song,&#10;lisa marie presley broke 2020,&#10