    id 437
    label "Rf3XmHIk9ng"
    step 0
    date "2020-07-14T20:00:04Z"
    title "Elvis Presleys Daughter Lisa Marie Has a Wild Life"
    description "Lisa Marie Presley may be the daughter of the King of Rock and Roll, Elvis Presley, but she isn't just some washed-up daddy's girl walking in her father's footsteps. She is an accomplished musician, songwriter and mother. &#10;&#10;Like this content? Subscribe here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/factsverse?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Or, watch more videos here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkXAntdjbcSKgHx6EQVOwNKVz1cR2hKVw&#10;&#10;She certainly has made a name for herself over the years, both for the good and the bad. She is no stranger for controversy and has had a string of bad luck that has followed her for years. Despite having four failed marriages that all ended in disaster, she has four children that she loves dearly, That's very obvious by how she has prioritized her family over the years. &#10;&#10;Lisa Marie has a tendency to date the wrong kind of men, she doesn't know how to manage her money and she has sure found her way into the gossip section of the tabloids over the years, but despite some of her more cringe-worthy life moments - which who doesn't have some of those - she has still managed to put out 3 certified gold records. &#10;&#10;Facts verse is going to take you through a brief overview of Lisa Marie Presley's life and show you just how wild it has been. Stick around till the end of the video to find out what her relationship with Michael Jackson was like.&#10;&#10;Elvis Presley's Daughter Lisa Marie Has a Wild Life"
