    title "Lisa Marie Claims Graceland #elvispresley #graceland"
    description "For the millions of admirers that visit Elvis Presley's Graceland estate in Memphis, TN, the residence is the only location where they can get up close and personal with the King of Rock and Roll.&#10;&#10;Graceland, on the other hand, serves as a private residence for Lisa Marie Presley and her extended family. The upstairs chambers are still off limits to the home tours, which began in 1983. The upper chambers, Lisa Marie confesses, are a &#34;creepy monument&#34; to a bygone age when her father was alive.&#10;&#10;Lisa Marie lives at Graceland. &#34;It's my childhood home,&#34; stated Graceland and its contents' owner, Elvis Presley's only daughter."
