    step 0
    date "2022-06-19T12:52:12Z"
    title "10 Legendary Cars of Elvis Presley"
    description "This video details 10 of Elvis Presley's legendary cars that he owned while he was alive.&#10;&#10;Even if you don't know anything about music, you've almost certainly heard of Elvis Presley. He was one of the most influential and best-selling artists of the twentieth century as the King of Rock and Roll. Elvis Presley is a cultural icon whose influence continues to this day,&#160;years after his death. Elvis Presley, a talented musician, actor, and showman, was one of the pioneers of rock and roll in the early 1950s. &#10;&#10;And he went on to become a global icon for millions of people. However, few people are aware that Elvis was a car collector. In fact, he had the unique habit of purchasing automobiles and donating them to his acquaintances, friends, and even family members.&#10;&#10;The cars shown in this video are:&#10;10. Ford Thunderbird 1962&#10;9. Ford Mustang&#10;8. Executive Lincoln Limousine&#10;7. Mark III Lincoln&#10;6. Mercedes-Benz 600&#10;5. Blackhawk Stutz&#10;4. Pantera de Tomaso&#10;3. Ferrari Dino 308 GT4&#10;2. Seville Cadillac&#10;1. Traditional Cadillac Miller-Meteor Hearse&#10;&#10;Please like and subscribe! https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYUJ0PDio7ZpsdNLATccMyg/?sub_confirmation=1"
