  [
    id 478
    label "2hv612S3C6w"
    step 0
    date "2021-08-16T23:38:37Z"
    title "Elvis Presley death Priscilla Presley "
    description "Elvis Presley's father thanks fans for letters and flowers following star's deathSign up for FREE now and never miss the top Royal stories again. Invalid emailWe use your sign-up to provide content in ways you've consented to and to improve our understanding of you. This may include adverts from us and 3rd parties based on our understanding. You can unsubscribe at any time. More infoThis article contains affiliate links, we may receive a commission on any sales we generate from it. Learn moreElvis Presley was found dead in his home at Graceland in 1977 on this day, August 16. The King of Rock and Roll was in the bathroom of his mansion and was found by his fianc&#233;e, Ginger Alden. His only child, Lisa Marie Presley, was just next door. The 42-year-old singer not only left behind a fianc&#233;e but also his ex-wife, Priscilla Presley, with who he still had a great connection. Priscilla said in 2016: &#34;I love him. I still love him. I&#8217;ve never not loved him. Ever.&#34;I feel that I&#8217;ve never really left him. And he knew that. He knew that.&#34; (Via The Sydney Morning Herald)The ex-wife of Elvis did not&#160;always have such a&#160;positive outlook about his death, however. In her 1985 memoir, Elvis and Me, she wrote: &#34;I locked myself in the bedroom and left instructions that I would not speak to anyone, that I wanted to be alone.&#34;Priscilla went on: &#34;In fact, I wanted to die.&#34;READ MORE:&#160;Elvis Presley Lisa Marie: 'I was a wreck after my father died'Elvis Presley's ex-wife Priscilla Presley was devastated by the news (Image: GETTY)Elvis Presley: Priscilla Presley spoke out about her ex-husband's death (Image: GETTY)What do you think? Should Elvis and Priscilla have stayed together? Join the debate in the comments section hereDespite the fact Priscilla and Elvis had gotten divorced four years earlier in 1973, they were still great friends. She recalled: &#34;Love is very deceiving. Though we were divorced, Elvis was still an essential part of my life.&#34;Over the last years, we&#8217;d become good friends, admitting the mistakes we&#8217;d made in the past and just beginning to laugh at our shortcomings.&#34;She then revealed: &#34;We had a bond: We&#8217;d become closer and had more understanding and patience for each other than in our married life. We even talked of one day&#8230; And now he was gone.&#34;Elvis Presley: Priscilla Presley had been with Elvis for years (Image: GETTY)Elvis Presley: Fans gather at Graceland for funeral in 1977Priscilla confessed she had never felt more &#34;afraid and alone&#34; in her entire life after Elvis died. This was partly because they still spent so much time together, despite the fact they had split years prior. She revealed: &#34;Elvis and I were very close, even after we divorced. He would still come over to my house. I would still sit in his lap.&#34;He would still call me my pet names that he gave me. He would still come to my house at two o&#8217;clock in the morning and talk for hours, and when I went to Graceland, it&#8217;s the same thing.&#34;DON'T MISS...&#10;&#10;&#10;All data is taken from the source: http://express.co.uk&#10;Article Link: https://www.express.co.uk/entertainment/music/1477642/elvis-presley-death-funeral-priscilla-presley&#10;&#10;&#10;#ElvisPresley #newmovies #newsworldwide #cnnnewstoday #newsworldnow #newstodayusa #"
