    title "Elvis Faked His Own Death - Elvis Presley sightings - Graceland - Breaking Music News 2019 Today"
    description "Welcome to Conspiracy Theory News.&#10;Today's top headline.&#10;Elvis Faked His Own Death.&#10;Allegedly, on August 16, 1977, the King of Rock and Roll died on his bathroom floor at only 42 years old. Suspiciouly there is some debate about the cause, although it was most likely a heart attack or cardiac episode brought on by heavy drug use. However, there are fans out there who are convinced that Elvis did not actually die that day, but instead faked his own death.&#10;According to these fans, Elvis Presley did it for a wide variety of reasons, including everything from getting away from the public eye to retire, all the way to getting away from the Mafia after teaming up with the FBI to take them down.&#10;The proof is the misspelling of his middle name, Aaron to Aron, on his gravestone, and of course, all the Elvis sightings that have been reported over the years.&#10;Some of the supposed Elvis sightings include multiple sightings in the town of Kalamazoo, Michigan. He was also spotted in a scene as an extra in the hit movie Home Alone, and most recently in disguise as a groundskeeper at his former home in Graceland. There was also the suspicious event in a 2005 interview with Oprah, when Lisa Marie Presley said &#8220;It&#8217;s exactly what he said the other day&#8221; in reference to her father. All this adds up to one thing: Elvis Presley is alive. He faked his own death. Elvis lives!"
